Revision history for KubeSeal

0.01    2026-01-04
        - Initial release
        - Sealer class for encrypting secrets
        - Unsealer class for decrypting secrets
        - Support for STRICT, NAMESPACE_WIDE, and CLUSTER_WIDE scopes
        - Certificate loading from files, URLs, and clusters
        - Private key loading with password support
        - Multi-key support for key rotation
        - Secret and SealedSecret model classes
        - YAML serialization/deserialization
        - Compatible with Bitnami kubeseal format
